	(text "Pack input: XT30 → TVS/filter → POWER LINK J4 → 1 mΩ shunt (Kelvin net-ties) → VBAT (bridges) ; VBAT → P-FET reverse-polarity → +VDRV (logic)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "09d41364-4438-4175-bc1f-519a81b1cfda")
	)
	(text "J1: '+' is pad 2 on the KiCad AMASS footprint.  Motor path is polarised by the connector only (PWR-3): a reversed pack destroys the board.  Q1: pack on DRAIN, load on SOURCE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0.0000)
		(effects
